  "details": "Udon SDK worlds will prevent many functions of Unity UI components as buttons or toggles to perform actions as:\n-Material.copyPropertiesFromMaterial\n-PostProcessingVolume.Profile\n*this two methods where tested, but the likelyhood of other affected methods is high*\nIf any of this actions is perform in a UI component, other totally normal actions as gameobject.active will not play.\nThis functions work perfectly on play mode, not on live.\nSDK version 2021.01.28.19.07",
